Jupiter rolled out its own Papertrade-like product offering 1000x leverage on crypto majors and did $1B in volume in its first day

@0xMerp what makes it a grift?

@0xMerp ah I didn't realize Papertrade invented 1000x perps

@0xMerp I get your point, I just also acknowledge that any good product is going to get copied in this industry

I actually kinda hate NY dude. lol. I have near ZERO desire to actually live in a city long term. I cannot express in words how much more I enjoy living in the burbs with clean sidewalks and nice downtowns and no homeless and no awful smell and running/hiking trails that are less than a mile from my front door and not sharing walls/ceilings/floors with my neighbors. 

Maybe if I had enough money to alleviate these things it’d be a different story but I need to like 100x my net worth for that hahahaha.

@paisitfwd Hahahaha. I had plenty of time. There were a few of us standing at the door thinking they would let us on but to no avail.

@BitcoinJesusETH if you've got any 100x investments... let me know 😉

@BitcoinJesusETH lmaoooo. Elite response. Maybe one day we'll sell enough books that i can just pay for an uber home next time rather than taking the train.

